  # Improvised Grenade: Empty Casing

  An empty casing is the base for improvised grenades. Fill it and choose a branch in the crafting graph to produce one of the variants.

  ## What You Can Craft and How
    ### To Craft a Pipe Bomb
      - A pipe bomb with a contact trigger and additional fragmentation components.
